Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us place you and those
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.76,0:00:06.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,you love under God's protection,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and walk into today in his peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.59,0:00:11.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you step out into today,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,stay with me for the next
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,few minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.44,0:00:17.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take one slow breath with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.07,0:00:18.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Maybe you are carrying
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.74,0:00:21.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,something heavy into this day:
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,a hard meeting, a long drive,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,a child going to school,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,news you are waiting for.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to face
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,any of it alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders drop.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.47,0:00:35.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Open your hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the next few minutes,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.09,0:00:38.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,simply rest in the shelter
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the Most High.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Psalm ninety-one begins like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He that dwelleth in the secret
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.74,0:00:49.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}place of the most High shall abide
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}under the shadow of the Almighty.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will say of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He is my refuge and my fortress:
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,my God;
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.02,0:01:00.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,in him will I trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice the word dwelleth.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.85,0:01:06.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protection here is not a visit
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,you make in an emergency.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is a place you live.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the psalmist does something simple:
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.57,0:01:15.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,he says it out loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:15.62,0:01:17.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will say of the Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:17.65,0:01:19.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,he is my refuge.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.24,0:01:21.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Today, you can say it too.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,So let us pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.77,0:01:25.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,this morning I choose
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,to dwell in your shelter.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:28.85,0:01:32.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are my refuge and my fortress.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.06,0:01:34.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,My God, in you I trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not begin this day
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,relying on my own
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,strength or my own plans.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I begin it hidden in you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:43.51,0:01:45.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The name of the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is a strong tower:
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.74,0:01:49.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,the righteous runneth into it,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.05,0:01:50.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,and is safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.66,0:01:54.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,A tower in the ancient world was
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.25,0:01:57.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,where people ran when danger came.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.17,0:01:59.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the strongest tower,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Solomon says,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,is not made of stone.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is the name of the Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.74,0:02:07.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whenever today feels unsafe,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:07.02,0:02:09.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can run into that name
Dialogue: 4,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,with one short prayer:
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus, help me.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.28,0:02:15.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will lift up mine
Dialogue: 5,0:02:15.77,0:02:17.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}eyes unto the hills,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from whence cometh my help.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}My help cometh from the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.73,0:02:24.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which made heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift my eyes to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,My help does not come
Dialogue: 4,0:02:29.94,0:02:31.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,from my bank account,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.55,0:02:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,my connections or my own cleverness.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.49,0:02:36.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,My help comes from you,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,the maker of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:38.61,0:02:40.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,The One who holds the stars
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.83,0:02:42.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,in place is watching
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,over my small day.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us be still for a moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,And breathe out.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.70,0:02:55.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Once more, breathe in, and rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.29,0:03:03.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let us pray protection
Dialogue: 4,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,over every part of this day,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,one by one.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, protect my mind today.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.05,0:03:12.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard me from anxious
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.74,0:03:14.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,thoughts that spiral,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:14.43,0:03:16.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,from lies about who I am,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.45,0:03:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and from fear that wants
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,to take over.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.61,0:03:20.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fill my thoughts
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,with what is true and good.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,When worry knocks,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your peace answer the door.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But the Lord is faithful,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who shall stablish you,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.22,0:03:33.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and keep you from evil.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.54,0:03:35.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.11,0:03:38.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my home under your protection.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.39,0:03:41.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch over every door and every room.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.68,0:03:42.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep away harm,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.98,0:03:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,accidents and every kind of danger.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let our home
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.11,0:03:48.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,be a place of peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.63,0:03:50.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,where your presence is felt
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.69,0:03:53.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the moment anyone walks in.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.12,0:03:56.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For he shall give his angels
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.26,0:03:57.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}charge over thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to keep thee in all thy ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,In all thy ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not only in church,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.11,0:04:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,not only on good days.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.28,0:04:09.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,On the highway, at the office,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.55,0:04:11.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the hospital waiting room,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.75,0:04:13.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the walk home.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is no road you will travel
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.67,0:04:19.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,today where God's care cannot reach you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.10,0:04:20.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.52,0:04:23.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect everyone who travels today.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every car, every bus,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,every train and every plane
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,carrying someone I love.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.81,0:04:32.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep drivers alert and roads safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring each one home again tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,safe and whole.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.85,0:04:38.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.45,0:04:40.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift up my family
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,one by one before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.11,0:04:43.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know their names,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,their needs and their
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,worries better than I do.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cover them with your protection.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard their health,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,their relationships and their hearts.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.93,0:04:55.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where any of them
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,are far from you,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,draw them gently closer.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.67,0:05:00.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.05,0:05:02.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray especially for the children.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch over them at school,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the playground,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,online and in every friendship.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect their innocence.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Surround them with good
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,influences and kind adults.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them grow up knowing
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.99,0:05:19.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,they are safe in your love.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The angel of the LORD encampeth
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}round about them that fear him,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.88,0:05:26.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and delivereth them.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.04,0:05:30.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Encampeth round about.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:30.23,0:05:32.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,The picture is an army setting
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,up camp all around you,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,on every side,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.29,0:05:38.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,through the night and through the day.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may feel exposed this morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,but heaven sees you surrounded.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.41,0:05:45.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,God's care is not thin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is all the way around.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.30,0:05:52.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, protect my work today.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard my reputation and my integrity.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from mistakes
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,that could hurt others,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and from people who would
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.68,0:06:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,take advantage.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me favour,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,wisdom and patience
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,with every person I meet.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.03,0:06:08.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.42,0:06:11.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect me from foolish decisions today.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I sign, agree,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,buy or reply,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me a pause
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.06,0:06:17.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a clear mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Close the doors that would
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.66,0:06:20.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,lead me into harm,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:20.99,0:06:23.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,even when they look attractive,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.28,0:06:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,and open the doors you have prepared.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.39,0:06:27.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.99,0:06:31.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my finances under your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect what you have
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me from loss,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.72,0:06:37.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,from deception and from waste.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.14,0:06:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to spend well,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.35,0:06:42.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,to save well and to give generously.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Provide for every need
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my home today.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my light
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and my salvation;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.35,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whom shall I fear?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD is the strength
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.25,0:06:55.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of my life;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.30,0:06:58.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of whom shall I be afraid?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.37,0:07:00.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,David does not answer
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.95,0:07:03.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,his fear with a technique.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:03.09,0:07:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,He answers it with a person.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my light.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.08,0:07:13.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fear shrinks when God is in view.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,So keep him in view today.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.05,0:07:19.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for protection over my body
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the bodies of those I love.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard us from sickness and injury.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.56,0:07:27.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen what is weak.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:27.68,0:07:30.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,For anyone already facing illness today,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.64,0:07:31.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,be their healer,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,their comfort and their peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give wisdom to every doctor
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,and nurse who cares for them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, protect my relationships.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard marriages from coldness and from
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.57,0:07:48.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,anything that would divide them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect friendships from
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,gossip and misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is tension,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring honest conversations
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and quick forgiveness.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.84,0:08:00.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let love win in every home today.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.01,0:08:02.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,set a guard over my mouth today.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.46,0:08:08.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect me from words I would regret:
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.62,0:08:11.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,harsh words, careless words,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,words spoken in anger.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let what I say build people up.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my words carry your peace
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,into every room I enter.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.05,0:08:21.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect my heart from bitterness,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.97,0:08:26.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,discouragement and despair.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.22,0:08:28.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,When disappointment comes today,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,do not let it settle in.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep my heart soft toward
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,you and toward others,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,and fill it again
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and again with hope.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.34,0:08:40.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For I the LORD thy God
Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.20,0:08:42.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}will hold thy right hand,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}saying unto thee, Fear not;
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will help thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.01,0:08:48.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.59,0:08:51.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect my heart and my faith.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from temptation and from
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything that would pull
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.37,0:08:56.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,me away from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to put on the whole
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,armour of God today:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,truth, righteousness, peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.65,0:09:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,faith,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your word in my mouth.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.49,0:09:07.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Finally, my brethren,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.97,0:09:09.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,be strong in the Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in the power of his might.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.83,0:09:14.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Put on the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able to stand
Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.04,0:09:18.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against the wiles of the devil.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be strong in the Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,not in yourself.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.35,0:09:26.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,The armour is his, not yours.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your part is to put it on,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to stand.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou art my hiding place;
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.46,0:09:36.39,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt preserve me from trouble;
Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt compass me about
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with songs of deliverance.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.95,0:09:45.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,A hiding place and songs of deliverance.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,God does not only hide
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.36,0:09:48.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,you from trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.99,0:09:50.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,He surrounds you with music
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even in a hard day,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.77,0:09:56.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,there can be a song underneath it:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.62,0:09:59.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,the quiet confidence that he has you,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.35,0:10:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and that this will
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,not be the end of the story.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.12,0:10:04.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.81,0:10:07.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for everyone listening
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.01,0:10:09.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,who woke up afraid this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those in unsafe homes,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,those in places of war,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.70,0:10:15.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,those facing a diagnosis,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.97,0:10:18.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,those who feel alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be their hiding place.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.09,0:10:23.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Surround them with songs of deliverance,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and send people to help them today.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be strong and of a good courage,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.69,0:10:30.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,fear not,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.43,0:10:32.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,nor be afraid of them:
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD thy God,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he it is that doth
Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}go with thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.74,0:10:38.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he will not fail thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor forsake thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,He it is that doth
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,go with thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Courage is not pretending
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,the danger is not there.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is knowing who walks
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside you into it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will not fail you.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.08,0:10:56.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will not forsake you.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not today, not ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in again, slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let it go.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Feel the peace of being
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.65,0:11:07.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,covered by God.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:12.99,0:11:15.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Say these words with me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,out loud if you can.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.95,0:11:18.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my refuge
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my fortress.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I dwell in the shelter
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.21,0:11:23.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the Most High.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,His angels watch over
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.65,0:11:27.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,me in all my ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,for God is with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,My family and my home
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.75,0:11:34.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,are in his hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,God himself answers in the psalm.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.79,0:11:40.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Because he hath set
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his love upon me,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}therefore will I deliver him:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.73,0:11:45.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will set him on high,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.49,0:11:47.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he hath known my name.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall call upon me,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will answer him:
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.72,0:11:54.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be with him in trouble;
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.23,0:11:55.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will deliver him,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.74,0:11:57.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and honour him.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.62,0:12:01.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Listen to why God protects:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,because he hath set
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.50,0:12:03.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,his love upon me,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,because he hath known my name.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.04,0:12:09.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protection flows out of relationship.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are not protected
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.95,0:12:13.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,because you are perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.08,0:12:16.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are protected because you are his.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.74,0:12:21.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,for every time you have protected
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,me without my even knowing it.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,The accidents that did not happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.38,0:12:28.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,The dangers I never saw.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for keeping
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.46,0:12:32.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,me until this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.33,0:12:35.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I trust you to keep me today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.08,0:12:36.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,make me a shelter for others today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me notice the person
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.35,0:12:42.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,who feels unsafe,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and offer kindness,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,help and prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you protect me,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.07,0:12:49.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me protect the weak and speak
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,up for those who cannot.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.48,0:12:52.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.99,0:12:56.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect my church and my neighbourhood.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.05,0:12:58.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch over the streets where I live,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.61,0:12:59.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the schools,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,the shops and the people
Dialogue: 4,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,who work in them.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.56,0:13:05.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring peace where there is violence,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.04,0:13:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,help where there is need,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let your people
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.07,0:13:10.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,be a light in this place.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.18,0:13:11.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,when this day is done,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.48,0:13:16.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring every one of us home safely.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us sit down tonight together,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,grateful for your protection.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I trust you with every
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour between now and then.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you go,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.10,0:13:29.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me read you some Scripture
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,to carry into this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let these words go with you,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.30,0:13:36.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,into every room and every road.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.45,0:13:40.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is the whole of Psalm ninety-one.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He that dwelleth in the secret
Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}place of the most High shall abide
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}under the shadow of the Almighty.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will say of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.62,0:13:52.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He is my refuge and my fortress:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.48,0:13:53.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my God;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.96,0:13:56.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in him will I trust.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely he shall deliver thee
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from the snare of the fowler,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.98,0:14:02.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and from the noisome pestilence.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall cover thee with his feathers,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and under his wings shalt thou trust:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his truth shall be thy
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.37,0:14:10.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shield and buckler.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.96,0:14:12.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou shalt not be afraid
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the terror by night;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.76,0:14:16.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor for the arrow
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that flieth by day;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Nor for the pestilence
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that walketh in darkness;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.72,0:14:23.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor for the destruction
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that wasteth at noonday.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.54,0:14:28.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}A thousand shall fall at thy side,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.31,0:14:31.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and ten thousand at thy right hand;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but it shall not come nigh thee.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.84,0:14:36.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Only with thine eyes shalt thou behold
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and see the reward of the wicked.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Because thou hast made the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is my refuge,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even the most High,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.43,0:14:46.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy habitation;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.83,0:14:49.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}There shall no evil befall thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall any plague
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}come nigh thy dwelling.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.81,0:14:54.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For he shall give his angels
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.94,0:14:56.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}charge over thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.24,0:14:58.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to keep thee in all thy ways.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}They shall bear thee
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.05,0:15:01.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}up in their hands,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.33,0:15:02.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}lest thou dash thy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}foot against a stone.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou shalt tread upon
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.91,0:15:07.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the lion and adder:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the young lion and the dragon
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.73,0:15:12.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shalt thou trample under feet.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Because he hath set
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.55,0:15:14.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his love upon me,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}therefore will I deliver him:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.09,0:15:18.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will set him on high,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he hath known my name.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall call upon me,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will answer him:
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be with him in trouble;
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will deliver him,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.11,0:15:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and honour him.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.48,0:15:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,With long life will I satisfy him,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.32,0:15:35.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,and shew him my salvation.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice how the psalm moves.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,It begins with a person
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.78,0:15:43.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,choosing to dwell with God,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:43.87,0:15:46.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it ends with God himself speaking:
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be with him in trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protection in this psalm
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,is not a promise that nothing
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.61,0:15:55.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,hard will ever happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is the promise that you will
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,never face it alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.09,0:16:03.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now the shepherd's psalm.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.51,0:16:05.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.70,0:16:07.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.58,0:16:09.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.16,0:16:11.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.24,0:16:14.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.78,0:16:21.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.87,0:16:22.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Yea,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.49,0:16:26.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.79,0:16:30.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.33,0:16:35.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.70,0:16:41.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.64,0:16:46.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.09,0:16:51.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.94,0:16:56.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Surely goodness and mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,shall follow me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.47,0:17:00.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Picture that today:
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.36,0:17:02.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,as you walk out of your door,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.57,0:17:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,goodness and mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.94,0:17:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,walk right behind you,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.62,0:17:06.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,all day long.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,The shepherd's rod and staff were
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.14,0:17:11.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,for protection and guidance.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,He uses both for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hear how Paul describes God's
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.94,0:17:19.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,protection for the believer.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.07,0:17:20.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wherefore take unto
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.53,0:17:22.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}you the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to withstand in the evil day,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.38,0:17:28.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having done all, to stand.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Stand therefore,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.05,0:17:32.99,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}having your loins girt about with truth,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.99,0:17:35.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having on the breastplate
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.13,0:17:36.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness;
Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.56,0:17:39.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And your feet shod with the preparation
Dialogue: 5,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the gospel of peace;
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Above all,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.02,0:17:43.99,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}taking the shield of faith,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.99,0:17:46.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wherewith ye shall be able to quench
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.62,0:17:49.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all the fiery darts of the wicked.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.29,0:17:51.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,And take the helmet of salvation,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.85,0:17:54.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the sword of the Spirit,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,which is the word of God.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.13,0:17:59.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,You will get dressed
Dialogue: 4,0:17:59.53,0:18:01.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,this morning anyway.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.10,0:18:01.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you do,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,put on the armour too.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Truth as your belt.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:06.05,0:18:08.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Righteousness over your heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:08.68,0:18:10.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Peace on your feet.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faith as your shield.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Salvation as your helmet.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,The word of God in your hand.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,And then, having done all,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.91,0:18:20.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,stand.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.07,0:18:23.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Listen to what God says
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the people he loves.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But now thus saith the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that created thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.24,0:18:29.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Jacob,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.89,0:18:31.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he that formed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.85,0:18:33.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Israel, Fear not:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I have redeemed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.51,0:18:38.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I have called thee by thy name;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou art mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When thou passest through the waters,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.59,0:18:44.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will be with thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and through the rivers,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.84,0:18:48.07,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they shall not overflow thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.07,0:18:50.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}when thou walkest through the fire,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.68,0:18:52.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt not be burned;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.73,0:18:54.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall the flame
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.58,0:18:56.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}kindle upon thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.13,0:19:00.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have called thee by thy name;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:00.64,0:19:02.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,thou art mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.46,0:19:05.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,God's protection is personal.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.11,0:19:07.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,He does not watch over a crowd.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.85,0:19:10.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,He watches over you, by name.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.51,0:19:11.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Through the waters,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:11.76,0:19:13.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,through the fire.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.06,0:19:14.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not around them,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,but through them, with him.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.79,0:19:18.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}What shall we then
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}say to these things?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}If God be for us,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who can be against us?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who shall separate us
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.59,0:19:27.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from the love of Christ?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall tribulation, or distress,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}or persecution, or famine,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.22,0:19:34.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}or nakedness, or peril,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}or sword?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.06,0:19:35.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Nay,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.36,0:19:37.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in all these things we are more
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}than conquerors through him
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.69,0:19:40.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that loved us.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For I am persuaded,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.41,0:19:44.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that neither death, nor life,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.70,0:19:47.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor angels, nor principalities,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.14,0:19:49.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor powers, nor things present,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.58,0:19:52.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor things to come, Nor height,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.02,0:19:52.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor depth,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor any other creature,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall be able to separate
Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}us from the love of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.34,0:20:04.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,If God be for us,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,who can be against us?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whatever you face today,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:08.91,0:20:10.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,you do not face it as
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,someone barely surviving.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:12.79,0:20:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,You face it as someone deeply loved.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.89,0:20:17.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nothing you meet today can
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,separate you from that love.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hear David's song of confidence.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my light
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and my salvation;
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whom shall I fear?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.89,0:20:31.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD is the strength
Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.80,0:20:32.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of my life;
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.86,0:20:35.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of whom shall I be afraid?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When the wicked,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even mine enemies and my foes,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.26,0:20:40.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}came upon me to eat
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.84,0:20:41.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}up my flesh,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.84,0:20:43.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they stumbled and fell.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Though an host should encamp against me,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.74,0:20:48.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my heart shall not fear:
Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.61,0:20:51.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}though war should rise against me,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.21,0:20:53.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in this will I be confident.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}One thing have
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I desired of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that will I seek after;
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that I may dwell
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the house of the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.49,0:21:03.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all the days of my life,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to behold the beauty of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.93,0:21:08.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and to enquire in his temple.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For in the time of trouble he
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall hide me in his pavilion:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.84,0:21:15.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the secret of his tabernacle
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall he hide me;
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.01,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall set me
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.01,0:21:19.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}up upon a rock.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.45,0:21:24.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the middle of enemies and armies,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.27,0:21:26.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,David asks for one thing:
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.41,0:21:28.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,to dwell with the Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:28.53,0:21:31.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,He knew that closeness to God was
Dialogue: 4,0:21:31.14,0:21:33.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,the safest place in the world.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.68,0:21:35.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let that be your one
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.19,0:21:36.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing today too.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay close,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.47,0:21:38.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let him set
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.70,0:21:40.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,you up upon a rock.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.94,0:21:44.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is our refuge and strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.48,0:21:47.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,a very present help in trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Therefore will not we fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.12,0:21:51.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the earth be removed,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.11,0:21:53.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and though the mountains be carried
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the midst of the sea;
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.64,0:21:57.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Though the waters thereof
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.29,0:21:58.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,roar and be troubled,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the mountains shake
Dialogue: 4,0:22:00.40,0:22:02.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the swelling thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,A very present help.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.44,0:22:07.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not a distant help
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,that arrives too late.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.68,0:22:10.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Present.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.98,0:22:12.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.08,0:22:13.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the trouble,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.19,0:22:15.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the very moment you need him.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.74,0:22:17.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even if the ground
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,seems to shake today,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.93,0:22:21.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,your refuge does not move.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.73,0:22:23.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,And finally,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,the traveller's psalm,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.35,0:22:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,for every road you take today.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will lift up mine
Dialogue: 5,0:22:29.33,0:22:30.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}eyes unto the hills,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.90,0:22:33.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from whence cometh my help.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.20,0:22:35.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}My help cometh from the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which made heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.52,0:22:38.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not suffer
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.87,0:22:40.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy foot to be moved:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.62,0:22:43.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.60,0:22:44.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Behold,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.10,0:22:46.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth Israel shall
Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.11,0:22:48.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither slumber nor sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.15,0:22:50.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is thy keeper:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:50.42,0:22:52.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD is thy shade
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}upon thy right hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.87,0:22:54.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The sun shall
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.88,0:22:56.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}not smite thee by day,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.59,0:22:58.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor the moon by night.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.48,0:23:00.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve
Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.21,0:23:01.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thee from all evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.82,0:23:04.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall preserve thy soul.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.41,0:23:06.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.37,0:23:08.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:23:08.10,0:23:09.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.84,0:23:11.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.61,0:23:16.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thy going out and thy coming in.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:16.42,0:23:18.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every time you leave a place
Dialogue: 4,0:23:18.55,0:23:20.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,today and every time you arrive,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:20.99,0:23:22.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Lord is there,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:22.36,0:23:24.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,at both ends of the journey.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:24.68,0:23:26.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Carry that with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.09,0:23:29.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is one thing
Dialogue: 4,0:23:29.48,0:23:31.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,to take into your day.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.47,0:23:34.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each time you leave a place today,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:34.19,0:23:35.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,your home, your car,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:35.79,0:23:37.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,your office, whisper,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my refuge.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:39.42,0:23:41.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Six words.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:41.09,0:23:42.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them mark every
Dialogue: 4,0:23:42.53,0:23:44.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,doorway you walk through.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:45.82,0:23:48.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now receive this blessing.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.39,0:23:50.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:23:50.32,0:23:52.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.03,0:23:53.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:53.75,0:23:55.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go into this day
Dialogue: 4,0:23:56.63,0:23:58.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,covered by his peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:58.28,0:24:01.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Jesus' name, amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:02.42,0:24:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you prayed this prayer with me,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.90,0:24:06.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,type amen in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:06.79,0:24:08.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and write the name of someone
Dialogue: 4,0:24:08.91,0:24:11.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,you want covered in prayer today.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:11.49,0:24:13.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Come back tomorrow morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:13.49,0:24:15.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and we will start the day
Dialogue: 4,0:24:15.34,0:24:17.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,with God together again.
